<title>HONG KONG: Arts Optical announces 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Arts Optical announces 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   22.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  13.29 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    60.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		     247.61</p>
<p>    Company name		 Arts Optical International Holdings</p>
<p>				     Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 17-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Eye glass frame manufacturer Arts Optical was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on November 8, 1996.</p>
<p>The company proposed a special dividend of 1.3 H.K. cents per share.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain represents interest income earned from application monies received in respect of the 84.5 million new shares issued by the company during the year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
